
# <type>(<scope>): <short description>
#
# Optional explanation of what changed and why.
#
# Refs: NIL-<issue>
#
# Types:
# feat      new NIL/compiler functionality
# fix       bug fix
# refactor  code change without behavior change
# perf      performance improvement
# test      tests
# docs      documentation/specification
# bench     benchmark changes
# exp       experimental/research work
# chore     tooling/dependencies/CI
#
# Scopes: parser, syntax, types, hir, mir, compiler, runtime, plugin,
#         codegen, cli, tokenbench, tokens, spec, ci
#
# Describe what changed, not what the agent did. Use an imperative summary.
# Avoid: Codex changes, update files, work on milestone, implemented stuff.
#
# Example:
# feat(parser): add function declaration parsing
#
# Implement parsing for typed function parameters and return types.
# Add parser tests for valid and malformed declarations.
#
# Refs: NIL-012
